WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.520
Friday, 9 p.m.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.060
Zack is sick. Tomorrow’s lineup has to be redone.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.920
Counting innings, the bench, the pitchers… all over again, every week.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.110
With BaseballLineup, his mom answers with a single tap.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.890
You tap Generate.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:24.380
Everyone sits on the bench just once, and Baseball Québec rules are followed.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.620
And it’s not always the same kids in the field: everyone tries new positions.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.960
You also know who you’re up against: their record, their pitchers, your chances of winning.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:42.360
The game sheet is ready. You show up on time, ready.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.650
So you can do what you really love: coaching your players.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.080
Less paperwork. More baseball.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.130
Create your team at baseballlineup.ca
